30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. The car is often left dirty or empty, and our weekly routines are the first things to fail.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,"Recording everything is a time sink, and those heavy-use weeks are absolute nightmares to coordinate. It's exhausting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are quite high, and the fuel spending is incredibly uneven. Some of us are paying far more than others.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Other groups say asking for favors is what ruins things. Also, checking each other's math just makes everyone feel accused.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The usage is totally uneven between weekdays and weekends. Plus, our short trips are wearing out the brakes and battery faster.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, if the fuel is that uneven, we definitely can't keep guessing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, so the ""favor"" system is the problem? That explains why I feel like I'm always negotiating.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. A simple split isn't fair if the usage is this lopsided.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. We need a way to stop the ""asking"" and the ""accusing.""","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the car is coming back empty, we need a rule about refueling before handover.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree, but a rule isn't a system. We need a structure.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"If recording every trip takes an hour a week, let's avoid a complex log.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Servas,,We need a balance between fairness and simplicity.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever we pick, it shouldn't make us feel like we're policing each other.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,But we can't ignore the costs Servas found.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
