55,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A gives me the predictability I need for my weekly trips. No more guessing if it's there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,Option A sounds easiest. No more coordinating every single run or spending hours on a calendar.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C is the most mathematically fair for the costs, but Takumi warned us about the tension of checking figures.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I hate Option C. It's just more ""checking figures"" and ""asking favors."" I vote for A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option C is the only way to be honest about the fuel, but if it ruins our friendship, it's not worth it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, would Option B work? One person in charge?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"That just puts all the stress on one person. I'm not doing it, and I don't want to beg someone else.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Option B is too informal. It returns us to the ""favor"" system Takumi mentioned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, Option B is a disaster waiting to happen.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"I guess A is the safest for our sanity, even if the money isn't perfect.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm sticking with A. It solves the handover and the weekly clash.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,May,,"Me too. Fixed days, fixed pay. Simple.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I still worry about the subsidy, but peace is more valuable. I'll vote A.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,A is the way to go. No more fighting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll go with A as well. Let's just keep it simple.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
